{'symbol': 'WY', 'date': '2022-05-19 16:30:00', 'title': 'WEYERHAEUSER COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF TIMBERLANDS IN NORTH AND SOUTH CAROLINA', 'text': 'SEATTLE , MAY 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WEYERHAEUSER COMPANY \xa0(NYSE: WY) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPLETION OF ITS ACQUISITION OF 80,800 ACRES OF HIGH-QUALITY TIMBERLANDS IN NORTH AND SOUTH CAROLINA FROM A FUND MANAGED BY CAMPBELL GLOBAL FOR APPROXIMATELY $265 MILLION. THE TRANSACTION WAS ANNOUNCED IN APRIL 2022.'}